    <div class="sidebar-meta">
      Written after the <strong>broken_oaths</strong> prod migration, 2026&#8209;09&#8209;05/06 — roughly twenty round trips finding one real bug after another, in the order below.<br><br>
      Applies to any project moving from a manually-run box onto code_my_spec's shared, automation-managed devops stack.
    </div>
